'''Evergreen''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2023 Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2023|2023 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended. 

== Appearance ==
It resembles a Christmas tree, which has a four-pointed star on the top that also has tinsels spiraling out of the star. It contains yellow lights, while the handle is brown resembling the bottom log of the Christmas tree.  

== Trivia ==
* It pairs with the godly gun [[Evergun]] making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Evergreen Set|Evergreen Set]].
* It has a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart called [[Chroma Evergreen]].
* On February 1st 2024, Evergreen and Chroma Evergreen were mass-duped, causing them to lose a lot of value.
** However, as of today, both of these items have gained value again.
* It was the main target, along with its Chroma counterpart, [[Chroma Evergreen]] in [[The Evergreen Glitch (2024)]].
* This, [[Candy]], [[BattleAxe]], [[BattleAxe II]], [[Bat]], [[Turkey]], [[Heart Wand]], and [[Embersickle]] are the only godly "[[knives]]" that do not resemble knives. 
* As of the [[Summer Event 2025|2025 Summer Event]] this along with [[Chroma Evergreen]], [[Evergun]] and [[Chroma Evergun]] received the [[FX Weapons|FX]] tag. 

